# This repository holds every client project, so the deployment is an ALLOW
# LIST, not a deny list: exclude everything, then name what the agency site
# actually needs. Anything not listed here will 404 on the live site even
# though it is committed — which is exactly what happened to the social card,
# the favicon and robots.txt until they were added below.

*

# Pages
!index.html
!privacy-policy.html
!terms-and-conditions.html
!sms-opt-in.html

# Images used by the site
!Brand_Assets
!Brand_Assets/**

# Search, sharing and browser chrome. The og:image in particular is only as
# good as its URL: a 404 here means links shared to Facebook, LinkedIn or
# iMessage render blank, which is the problem it was added to solve.
!social-card.png
!favicon.svg
!apple-touch-icon.png
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
